# The independent witness's own storage and mirror, which belong to the
# WAREHOUSE's trust domain rather than to the database whose authority they
# witness. A restore of the accounts database must not restore the witness, so
# none of these may ever point at anything accounts can write.
#
# DELIBERATELY EMPTY, and this is the whole point of the file. The group has to
# ship a local default or the host cannot declare it at all, but a value here
# would be a development bypass: the witness refuses to boot without a real
# bucket and a real warehouse endpoint, and it must go on refusing locally. An
# empty value keeps that refusal and still satisfies the declaration.
#
# A real deployment supplies these through Codefly's configuration provider,
# against a dedicated bucket whose IAM forbids deleting or replacing anything
# under `entries/`.
POLICY_LOG_BUCKET=
POLICY_LOG_WAREHOUSE_ENDPOINT=
